@HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213

### Health check
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Register
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "confirmPassword": "test123"
}

###

### Login (2FA kapalıysa doğrudan Token/RefreshToken döner;
### açıksa RequiresTwoFactor=true + PreAuthToken döner, ardından
### aşağıdaki "2FA ile giriş" isteğini kullanın)
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

###

### 2FA ile giriş (Login'den dönen PreAuthToken + authenticator kodu)
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/2fa/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preAuthToken": "{{preAuthToken}}",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### 2FA kurulumu (QR/paylaşılan anahtar üretir) — Bearer token gerektirir
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/2fa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2FA'yı etkinleştir (authenticator uygulamasındaki kodla) — Bearer token gerektirir
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/2fa/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Alışkanlıkları getir (Bearer token gerektirir)
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits?page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
